                  "text": "10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“An Yecu atyeko cwayo amalaikana me rab kop man me caden baŋwu pi lwak jo oye an i kabedo luŋ. An Lwit-yat a Daudi, me doggola mere ikome, an Etop a mimila acil meicel.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.16"
            ]
          }
